<title>UK: Newman Tonks to reply to FKI document Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Newman Tonks to reply to FKI document Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newman Tonks Group Plc said on Friday it would respond on January 6 to the offer document from predator FKI Plc, posted a week ago.</p>
<p>Newman Tonks said earlier this month that FKI's 195.7 million stg hositile bid undervalued the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
